            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So when it's night here, it's day somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "Yes! While you're sleeping, kids on the other side of the world are waking up.",
      "punch": "waking",
      "board": {
